1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,780
I want to first talk about something I think that you should avoid when you go to the grocery store.
我想先聊聊去杂货店时，我觉得应该避免的一些东西。

2
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:12,250
I think you should avoid those pre packaged pre sliced pre chopped vegetables and ingredients.
我觉得应该避开那些预先包装、切片、切好的蔬菜和食材。

3
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:20,270
Unless you are so insanely busy you quite literally have no time to cook for yourself at home.
除非你忙得不可开交，实在没有时间在家给自己做饭。

4
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:25,010
Um unless you need like the utmost convenience I recommend avoiding it.
嗯，除非你需要极致的便利，否则我建议避开它们。

5
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:33,240
Again you might have kids a super busy life you have no time maybe you have 30 minutes to eat dinner before you like end work and go to your next thing.
再说，你可能有孩子、生活特别忙，没什么时间，或下班后赶下一件事之前只有三十分钟吃饭。

6
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:41,400
Or maybe you have some kind of physical limitation or illness or disability that prevents you from standing in the kitchen cooking chopping prepping.
或者你有身体限制、疾病或残障，无法站在厨房做饭、切菜、备餐。

7
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:48,360
If any of that applies to you go for it get the pre sliced zucchini the pre chopped sweet potatoes go for it.
如果这些情况符合你，就去买吧，买预先切片的西葫芦、切好的红薯，没问题。

8
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:54,240
But I feel like if you're anybody else and you have the time and you have the energy and you don't want to spend a lot of money.
但我觉得，如果你不属于那些情况，又有时间、有精力，也不想花很多钱……

9
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:58,680
I recommend just buying the produce the ingredients and things as they are.
我建议买原样的农产品、食材之类的东西。

10
00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:04,320
I recommend this for a few reasons one it's going to teach you how to cook how to chop vegetables how to prepare them how to set them up.
我这样建议有几个原因：第一，这能教你做饭、切菜、处理蔬菜，以及把它们准备好。

11
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:11,759
Two it's a lot more cost effective and especially with prices these days I don't like to always pay for convenience unless I absolutely have to.
第二，这样划算得多，尤其考虑到如今的价格，除非确实必要，我不喜欢总是花钱买便利。

12
00:01:11,759 --> 00:01:19,789
And three I feel like the times I have bought those pre chopped items before I feel like they go bad a lot quicker so that's just my opinion.
第三，我觉得我以前买的预切食材坏得更快，所以这只是我的看法。

13
00:01:19,799 --> 00:01:27,900
Something that I like to do when I grocery shop which has made me very successful is following a five four three two one sort of pattern when I'm shopping.
我买菜时喜欢的一种方法、也是我觉得很有效的方法，就是按五四三二一这样的模式来买。

14
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:35,160
Starting with five five fruits and veggies okay you want to really fill up that meal prep that play eat that whatever with fruits and veggies.
从五开始：五种水果蔬菜。你要把备好的餐、那个盘子之类的东西装上蔬果。

15
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:40,020
And I'm sorry if you're someone that doesn't like fruits and veggies sorry you're an adult now you gotta start liking something.
抱歉，如果你不喜欢水果蔬菜，抱歉，你已经是成年人了，总得开始喜欢其中一些吧。

16
00:01:40,020 --> 00:01:44,639
Now you can do five fruits five veggies or you can do like a mix of everything you need.
你可以买五种水果、五种蔬菜，或者把需要的各种东西搭配着买。

17
00:01:44,639 --> 00:01:50,999
Just five vegetables you can do four veggies one fruit whatever you want to do but at least at least five.
只买五种蔬菜也行，四种蔬菜加一种水果也行，随你，但至少得有五种。

18
00:01:50,999 --> 00:01:54,419
And these are things I typically go for when I'm going to the grocery store.
这些就是我去杂货店时通常会选的东西。

19
00:01:54,419 --> 00:02:02,330
And also I don't know if anybody's told you but it is totally fine and I think sometimes even better to opt for frozen and canned items.
还有，不知道有没有人告诉过你，选冷冻和罐装食品完全没问题，我觉得有时甚至更好。

20
00:02:02,340 --> 00:02:07,020
That's why a lot of people don't like to meal prep or they don't like to do things like this because they're eating the same thing all the time.
很多人不喜欢备餐，或不喜欢做这些事，就是因为他们总是在吃同样的东西。

21
00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:13,850
And it's just like really really boring and nobody wants to eat broccoli every single day they just they just don't okay unless you're a rabbit or something.
这真的很无聊，也没人想每天吃西兰花，就是不想，好吧，除非你是只兔子什么的。

22
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:18,540
Four is gonna be our protein so I'm kind of speaking specifically to those that eat meat.
第四项是蛋白质来源，这里我主要是对吃肉的人说的。

23
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:21,839
I want you to pick four proteins at least that you really really like.
我要你至少挑四种自己特别喜欢的蛋白质来源。

24
00:02:21,839 --> 00:02:34,800
So for me personally my four go to proteins are chicken ground turkey salmon and then that fourth one is usually something like tuna or I usually do like tuna or cod or something.
对我来说，四种常选的是鸡肉、火鸡肉末、三文鱼，第四种通常是金枪鱼，或者鳕鱼之类的。

25
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:39,300
Again you're welcome to do whatever you want with those four if you prefer plant based proteins do that.
当然，这四种你想怎么选都可以。如果你更喜欢植物性蛋白质，就选那种。

26
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:46,499
If you prefer to substitute for some kind of bean or legume or tofu totally go for that as well whatever works for you and your lifestyle.
如果你更愿意换成豆类、豆科食物或豆腐，也完全可以，适合你和你的生活方式就行。

27
00:02:46,499 --> 00:02:49,790
I'm just gonna get a t shirt that says whatever works for you.
我都想弄件印着“适合你就好”的 T 恤了。

28
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:56,339
My biggest and best tip when it comes to buying proteins is sort of buying them in bulk.
我购买蛋白质食物最重要、最好用的建议，就是批量购买。

29
00:02:56,339 --> 00:03:04,800
Ever since I started following this little routine and this tip I buy meat maybe like four if not five times a year.
自从开始遵循这个小习惯和建议，我一年买肉大概就四次，甚至五次。

30
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:10,080
That might sound really weird but hear me out so every so often I'll go to the store and I will just kind of stock up on me.
听起来可能很奇怪，但先听我说。我隔一段时间会去商店，囤一些东西。

31
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:15,240
So if you have a memberships like costco's bjs whatever it is this is your chance to shine.
所以，如果你有 Costco、BJ's 之类的会员，这就是你发挥它作用的时候了。

32
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:20,460
But also I get a lot of my meat from just like regular grocery stores harris teeter the fresh market whole foods whatever.
不过，我很多肉也是在普通杂货店买的，比如 Harris Teeter、The Fresh Market、Whole Foods 等。

33
00:03:20,460 --> 00:03:24,419
I will buy a big pack of chicken breasts I will buy several packages of ground turkey.
我会买一大包鸡胸肉，再买几包火鸡肉末。

34
00:03:24,419 --> 00:03:28,139
I will buy like a handful of canned tuna from the store.
我会在商店买几罐金枪鱼。

35
00:03:28,139 --> 00:03:31,319
I will go to the meat counter and get a couple pounds of salmon.
我会去鲜肉柜台买几磅三文鱼。

36
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:38,640
And I dedicate like an hour of time to cutting it splitting it separating it storing it and freezing it.
然后我会专门花大概一小时，把它们切好、分开、分装、收好，再冷冻起来。
